      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners on Garratt Lane consistently commend the veterinary and nursing team for their approachable, attentive, and kind care. Reviewers appreciate that clinicians listen without rushing, answer complex questions, and provide clear treatment plans. Aside from one critical review regarding post-operative care, the staff receive high praise."
