      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly highlight how gently staff handle nervous dogs and anxious cats during examinations. Clients mention that timid rescues settle quickly thanks to unhurried appointments and a calm consultation environment. Owners appreciate dedicated cat areas and patient handling that transform stressful visits into positive experiences."
      }
    },
    {
