        "en": "Effective treatments and thorough procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report successful treatment outcomes ranging from emergency wound care and pain management to specialised laparoscopic spaying. Pet parents appreciate detailed aftercare notes and prompt recovery following surgical procedures. While one reviewer shared grief over complex post-surgical complications, overall medical feedback remains strong."
      }
    }
